Product Backlog 
(/WishList LinkforGame) The bot will have a way to receive and store games that users wishlist
(/List) The bot will have the ability to list all wishlists from all users per-server
(/PullPricing LinkForGame) The bot will have the ability to check and list prices and discounts on specified games from various stores (Steam, Epic Games, etc.)
(/Compare) The bot will have the ability to compare the prices and discounts it finds with games listed in user’s wishlists and the same game listed in the specified store 
There will also be an implementation to compare manually and compare on a specified recurring schedule 
(/Daily ChannelID) The bot will have the ability to post a daily digest of wishlists and discounts 
